A '''Furisode Girl''' (Japanese: '''ふりそで''' ''Furisode'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] introduced in [[Generation VI]]. They are depicted as young girls and young women wearing black, blue, pink and purple, or white {{wp|furisode}}. They also appear in the [[Battle Chateau]], although they are classed as {{tc|Marchioness}}es and {{tc|Duchess}}es, and exclusively use teams of {{p|Audino}}. 

In the [[Battle Maison]], Furisode Girls typically use any of {{p|Eevee}}'s [[Eeveelution|Evolutions]]. In {{g|Legends: Z-A}}, Furisode Girls exclusively use {{type|Fairy}} Pokémon, with most using at least one {{p|Florges}}.

